55,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option A is simple, but B allows for different levels, and C is the most flexible for newcomers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option A is the dream for a treasurer. Option C is a logistical disaster.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option B addresses the unfairness of the ""dozen faces"" carrying the club, but A is cleaner.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is definitely out; it's already driving people away from weekday events.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option A gives us a predictable budget, which is what we've been missing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, would Option B create a social divide? I worry it would make the ""lower"" members feel unwelcome.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,I agree with Asuka. Tiers often create a hierarchy that kills the club spirit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a risk. If the goal is inner peace and inclusivity, maybe A is better despite the uneven usage.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll vote against C. Between A and B, A feels less like a ""grade"" system.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we go with A, we just need to be flexible with how people pay it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I can support A if we allow monthly installments to help those who can't pay upfront.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,That's a fair compromise. It keeps the bookkeeping manageable but remains accessible.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'm convinced. Let's prioritize the harmony of the group over the precision of the cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Agreed. Let's keep it simple so people stop weighing up whether to come.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm in. A predictable annual sum is the only way to stop the guesswork.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
